(471, 1, '2025-07-02 08:35:53', '2025-07-02 08:35:53', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.7 - 03-07-2022 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>Headline that grabs people\'s attention</h1>		\n			<a href=\"https://demo.athemes.com/botiga-beauty-el/shop/\" role=\"button\">\n						SHOP NOW\n					</a>\n			<h2>Featured Collection</h2>		\n		<p>A powerful headline about your product’s features to give focus to your chosen product collection</p>[products columns=\"3\" limit=\"3\"]		\n			<h2>Highlighted Section</h2>		\n		<p>What differentiates you from the competition? Use this section to talk about it. Don’t forget to talk about the benefits.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://demo.athemes.com/botiga-beauty-el/shop/\" role=\"button\">\n						SHOP NOW\n					</a>\n			<h2>Featured Categories</h2>		\n		<p>Give your customers insight into your product collection. Select imagery and name that relates to the product category.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.7 - 03-07-2022 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>									<figure>\n											<a href=\"https://demo.athemes.com/botiga-beauty-el/product-category/cosmetics/\">\n							<img width=\"510\" height=\"490\" src=\"http://localhost/final%20project_3/wp-content/uploa