ect for students or casual users.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"539\"></p>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'asus-14%e2%80%b3-fhd-laptop', '', '', '2025-07-06 16:27:42', '2025-07-06 16:27:42', '', 0, 'http://localhost/final%20project_3/?post_type=product&#038;p=630', 0, 'product', '', 0),
