(764, 1, '2025-07-03 14:24:03', '2025-07-03 14:24:03', '<ul data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"1243\">\r\n 	<li data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"584\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"553\">Type:</strong> Wireless Over-Ear Headphones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"647\"><strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"609\">Noise Cancelation:</strong> Industry-leading dual processor ANC</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"740\"><strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"667\">Battery Life:</strong> Up to 30 hours (with ANC), quick charge: 3 hours playback in 3 minutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"819\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"759\">Microphones:</strong> 4 beamforming mics with noise suppression for clear calls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"886\">\r\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"886\"><strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"843\">Voice Assistants:</strong> Compatible with Alexa &amp; Google Assistant</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"947\"><strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"907\">Audio Quality:</strong> High-Resolution Audio with LDAC codec</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1016\"><strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"967\">Connectivity:</strong> Bluetooth 5.2, multipoint connection supported</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1078\"><strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1038\">Smart Features:</strong> Adaptive Sound Control, Speak-to-Chat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1151\"><strong data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1101\">Foldable Design:</strong> No (Redesigned smooth