(1075, 1, '2025-07-06 20:16:03', '2025-07-06 20:16:03', '<h5>All Your Favorite Gadgets in One Cart</h5>				\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/final%20project_3/?post_type=product\">\n									SHOP NOW\n					</a>\n					<h2>Featured Collection</h2>				\n		<p data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"391\"><strong data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"391\">A handpicked collection of the most wanted smart devices on the market.</strong></p>[products columns=\"3\" limit=\"3\"]		\n					<h2>Why Choose Smartify?\n</h2>				\n		<p data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"663\">At Smartify, we don’t just sell electronics — we deliver a smarter way to shop.<br data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"359\" />Our products are carefully curated to guarantee top performance, sleek design, and real value for your money.<br data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"473\" />With fast shipping, trusted brands, and dedicated customer support, Smartify makes your tech buying experience easy, reliable, and satisfying.<br data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"620\" />Discover how shopping smart really feels.</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/final%20project_3/?post_type=product\">\n									SHOP NOW\n					</a>\n					<h2>Featured Categories</h2>				\n		<p><strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"256\">Explore Our Most Popular Tech Categories</strong><br data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"259\" />From smartphones to smartwatches, laptops to accessories — we’ve organized our top-selling products into easy-to-browse categories.<br data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"395\" />Find exactly what you need, faster.</p>		\n												<figure>\n											<a href=\"http://localhost/final%20project_3/?product_cat=oppo\">\n							<img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost/final%20project_3/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Copilot_20250703_162847.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n											<figcaption>OPPO</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n												<figure>\n											<a href=\"https://demo.athemes.com/botiga-beauty-el/product-category/cosmetics/\">\n							<